<view class="page container">
  <view class="hero">
    <text class="hero-kicker">欢迎使用</text>
    <text class="hero-title">Ares</text>
    <text class="hero-desc">账号管理与站内通知工具。打开即可浏览介绍与帮助，登录可在体验后自行选择。</text>
  </view>

  <view class="section-hd">服务介绍</view>
  <view class="feature-card" bindtap="goMembership">
    <view class="feature-icon">会</view>
    <view class="feature-body">
      <text class="feature-title">会员</text>
      <text class="feature-desc">查看会员等级与权益，登录后可申请开通。</text>
    </view>
    <text class="feature-arrow">›</text>
  </view>
  <view class="feature-card" bindtap="goNotify">
    <view class="feature-icon">讯</view>
    <view class="feature-body">
      <text class="feature-title">服务动态</text>
      <text class="feature-desc">打开即可看到服务动态；登录后可接收微信提醒。</text>
    </view>
    <text class="feature-arrow">›</text>
  </view>
  <view class="feature-card" bindtap="goProfile">
    <view class="feature-icon dark">我</view>
    <view class="feature-body">
      <text class="feature-title">个人中心</text>
      <text class="feature-desc">体验后再到「我的」自行选择是否登录。</text>
    </view>
    <text class="feature-arrow">›</text>
  </view>
  <view class="feature-card" bindtap="goHelp">
    <view class="feature-icon gray">帮</view>
    <view class="feature-body">
      <text class="feature-title">使用帮助</text>
      <text class="feature-desc">阅读下方指南与常见问题，了解如何使用本小程序。</text>
    </view>
    <text class="feature-arrow">›</text>
  </view>

  <view class="section-hd">使用指南</view>
  <view class="guide-card">
    <view class="guide-item">
      <text class="guide-num">1</text>
      <view class="guide-body">
        <text class="guide-title">浏览首页</text>
        <text class="guide-desc">无需登录，先了解服务内容与使用方式。</text>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="guide-item">
      <text class="guide-num">2</text>
      <view class="guide-body">
        <text class="guide-title">查看消息</text>
        <text class="guide-desc">在「消息」阅读公告；个人消息需登录后查看。</text>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="guide-item">
      <text class="guide-num">3</text>
      <view class="guide-body">
        <text class="guide-title">管理资料</text>
        <text class="guide-desc">需要时再到「我的」自行登录并完善资料。</text>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="guide-item">
      <text class="guide-num">4</text>
      <view class="guide-body">
        <text class="guide-title">开通会员</text>
        <text class="guide-desc">在「会员」查看等级权益，登录后可申请开通，运营处理后生效。</text>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="section-hd">常见问题</view>
  <view class="faq-card">
    <view
      wx:for="{{faqs}}"
      wx:key="id"
      class="faq-item"
      data-id="{{item.id}}"
      bindtap="toggleFaq"
    >
      <view class="faq-q">
        <text>{{item.q}}</text>
        <text class="faq-toggle">{{item.open ? '−' : '+'}}</text>
      </view>
      <text class="faq-a" wx:if="{{item.open}}">{{item.a}}</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="notice-card">
    <text class="notice-title">服务说明</text>
    <text class="notice-text">本小程序提供会员、服务动态、站内通知与账号管理。打开即可浏览介绍，登录后可申请会员并管理资料。</text>
  </view>
</view>
